Package: com.brooktrout12.rockantenneadblock
Name: ROCK ANTENNE AdBlock (Test 2)
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Experimental app-scoped ad blocker for ROCK ANTENNE on iOS 17 and 18.
 Skips SDK-managed AdsWizz ads using the documented AdManager interface,
 filters selected ad requests and records playback diagnostics. Experimental.
Maintainer: Brooktrout12
Author: Brooktrout12
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 17.0), firmware (<< 19.0), mobilesubstrate
Tag: role::enduser

